export anchor OutlineDarkStyle:
    number: 246
    screen: DesignEditor
    name: Outline dark
    idea: Every panel, control and even the canvas preview is a thin line drawing on pure black with no fills, so structure shows as wireframe and one mint line marks what is active.
    base: dark
    palette:
        black: #000000, every surface
        line: #7a7a7a, outlines of panels, boxes and controls
        faint: #3a3a3a, inner dividers, rulers and element outlines, never text
        ink: #ededed, text and the outline view drawing
        muted: #a8a8a8, mono labels, key hints and type icons
        mint: #5ef0c0, the active tool, selected row, frame outline, Share, Saved and focus
        pink: #ff8fc8, the spacing guide and one avatar ring
        amber: #ffc46b, the comment pin and one avatar ring
    type:
        System ui for text, system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue,
        Arial, and ui-monospace for labels, values and buttons. Body 13px
        at 1.45. Labels are 11px mono caps tracked 0.1em, buttons 12px mono
        caps, values 13px mono, and the sheet title 24px 600.
    layout:
        A row of separate outlined boxes forms the top, the CANVAS mark
        with the file path, a joined strip of six 52px tools each showing
        its key letter under the icon with Move outlined mint, a Zoom 66%
        box, the three ringed initials and the Present and Share buttons.
        The canvas fills the left in its own outline with mono rulers along
        the top and left. The frame is shown in outline view, a mint frame
        line with square handles, element outlines in faint grey, white
        headline text on black, an outlined button and a crossed screenshot
        box. The right column stacks the inspector over the layers, each
        outlined. The inspector is a ruled grid of 38px property cells for
        X, Y, W, H, Fill, Layout, Gap, Pad, Radius and Export. Layer rows
        are 32px, the selected row outlined mint with a Selected flag.
        Status words sit in three outlined boxes, Saved in mint. Below
        760px the right column hides, the brand takes a full row and an
        outlined strip of six tools sits under the canvas.
    spacing: 12px gutters between outlined boxes, 38px property rows, 32px layer rows, 36 to 40px around the frame.
    density: Medium. Canvas on the left, inspector over layers on the right.
    corners: Square everywhere. Only the avatars are round.
    borders: 1px #7a7a7a outlines on every box and control and #3a3a3a dividers inside. Active things swap to a 1px mint outline.
    shadows: None and no fills at all, even the canvas is drawn as outlines.
    icons:
        18px line icons at 1.25px stroke with square caps and mitred joins.
        Saved uses a check circle, editing two people and the version a tag,
        each in its own outlined box with words.
    focus: A 1px dashed mint outline offset 3px, and a mint inset line on fields.
    tone: Technical mono caps, such as Inspector, Outline view and Export.
